  fixedTimestep: 0.01
  maxDurationSeconds: 243.6
  intent: 'esc-006 The Exit Shrinks Every Round. v4''s rotating gap (20deg/s, speed
    6-13, 7 rounds), exit narrows from 35deg on round 1 to 20deg on round 7. Playtests
    2026-10-13: 30->18 favoured the wall, 45->20 made the ball too strong. Modelled
    ball-escape odds 82% on round 1 to 31% on round 7 (~4.1 of 7); the model runs
    about one win generous to the ball, so expect a near coin-flip 4-3 series. HUD
    shows live how many balls fit across the exit.'
